{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_CyMO-21.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/2007_CyMO-21.PNG/250px-2007_CyMO-21.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"148\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/2007_CyMO-21.PNG/375px-2007_CyMO-21.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/2007_CyMO-21.PNG/500px-2007_CyMO-21.PNG 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>In the figure, three equal cycles of diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7d7e20a0098b4c5afb6e03535ff8dd51ecd9461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\,\\mathrm{ cm}$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> represent pulleys, that are connected with a strap. If the distances between any two pulley center points are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/2/5f28b075f2a4be81e23f57fbf519534fc62c1ee2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=3\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdfbcaa98933546199a1c84f7806cd73792dc52f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=4\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f10f72fe6186ab0fe3f2261206c98bb272b55c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=5\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" />, then the length of the strap is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05ae354f655d3b100beed085a7a088d0e0dc5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } (12+20\\pi)\\,\\mathrm{m}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } (12 + \\pi)\\,\\mathrm{m}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } (12+ 4\\pi)\\,\\mathrm{m}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\left(12+\\frac\\pi5\\right)\\,\\mathrm{m}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{None\\,of\\,these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"779\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lengths of the straight parts of the strap are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c83e4e52006dfd15403fbfc564e7290b2c50361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/4/8a4402ff4720ad4ab3ecdbd2582e4563a06d788d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f88bdd0352030c995083398dbfb69499377fcb41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />. Their sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/e/93e4358550ef2495140e24a5ffbd72466746842d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\,\\mathrm{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. The curved parts of the band add up to a full circumference of one of the circles, so their sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/dea1306aca4ca73f453b165c6a9c18dd2cbe6dba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\pi\\,\\mathrm{ cm}$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />. The total length of the strap is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d8af7a28ae131c4f1908288c5a883f75423d925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12+\\frac\\pi5)\\,\\mathrm{m}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"140\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki